  "finalText": "I built the animated bar chart in the 6 s composition, and the contact sheet shows it playing as intended.\n\n- **Title:** **Revenue by quarter** sits top-left with a \"$M, 2025\" subline. The \"2025\" is my addition, since you didn't give a year. Both fade up.\n- **Axis:** the baseline draws left to right from 0.3 s, and the Q1–Q4 labels fade in under it.\n- **Bars:** they grow up from the baseline one after another, about 0.35 s apart, in muted blue-grey (12, 18, 15, 27).\n- **Value labels:** each label fades and slides up above its bar as that bar finishes. They fade in rather than counting up the numbers.\n- **Q4:** the **Q4 bar** grows with a springy overshoot and turns accent orange. Its larger \"27\" label pops in with a scale-up. The Q4 axis label is orange too.\n- **Timing:** everything is in place by about 3.2 s and then holds until 6 s.\n\nI can add a count-up on the numbers, shorten the piece, or add a subtle exit."
